Explanation of the change:

- We grab the raw scale (`this.getScale()`) once.
- We note whether it was originally an array (`isArrayScale`).
- We only suppress the scale in the clone (i.e. set it to `undefined`) if it truly was an array (or came through width/height paths).  
- A pure numeric scale now remains a number in the cloned icon, preserving both its value and its type.
